        {
            "block_label": "table",
            "block_content": "<table><tr><td>Element name</td><td>Type</td><td>Semantics</td></tr><tr><td>TimeAnchor</td><td>simpleType:xs-unsignedLong</td><td>The time at which the receipt was issued. The value is encoded at microseconds resolution in SECC time, a concept that is defined in 8.3.3.3.</td></tr><tr><td>EnergyCosts</td><td>complexType:DetailedCostTyperefer to Annex A for the type definition</td><td>Optional:Energy cost - reported in amount (kWh) and costPerUnit (current per kWh).</td></tr><tr><td>OccupancyCosts</td><td>complexType:DetailedCostTyperefer to Annex A for the type definition</td><td>Optional:Occupancy cost - reported in amount (duration) and costPerUnit (cost per duration).</td></tr><tr><td>AdditionalServicesCosts</td><td>complexType:DetailedCostTyperefer to Annex A for the type definition</td><td>Optional:Cost of additional services - name of service, and cost of the service</td></tr><tr><td>OverstayCosts</td><td>complexType:DetailedCostTyperefer to Annex A for the type definition</td><td>Optional:Overstay cost - reported in amount (duration) and costPerUnit (current per duration).</td></tr><tr><td>TaxCosts</td><td>complexType:DetailedTaxTyperefer to 8.3.5.3.60</td><td>Optional:Tax cost - name of tax rule and cost of the tax</td></tr></table>",
